  "source": {
    "template": "QMH Cancer Reporting Template - GI-Appendix (Appendiceal tumours)",
    "url": "https://awiloqmh.github.io/CancerReportingTemplate/GI-Appendix.html",
    "staging": "AJCC 8th edition pTNM derived from the tumour-extension ticks, the nodal counts, the tumour deposits and the distant-metastasis options; pTis(LAMN) applies to a LAMN confined by the muscularis propria, N2a (4-6) / N2b (7+) follow the involved-node count and M1a / M1b / M1c follow the peritoneal patterns. Cycling the extension options wipes the override. pTNM prints only with the printPTNM option, stamped (AJCC 8th edition); the stage-group line also prints there.",
    "stagingProtocol": "appendix",
    "grading": "WHO 2019 digestive tumours histologic type and grade; Tang group A/B/C mapped to WHO grades for goblet cell adenocarcinoma; the QMH page's 'Goblet cell carcinoid' is rendered as 'Goblet cell adenocarcinoma' (WHO-current). The QMH page has no treatment-effect field; the y descriptor is left to the override."
  },
